#: kamu/templates/email/account_created_message.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"A University of Helsinki limited user account has been created for you: "
"%(uid)s.\n"
"\n"
"From now on, please use this limited user account when logging in to the "
"services of the University of Helsinki.\n"
"\n"
"For more information on how to use the username, please see the IT Helpdesk "
"instructions %(help_link)s"
msgstr ""
"Hei,\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Sinulle on luotu Helsingin yliopiston kevyttunnus: %(uid)s.\n"
"\n"
"Käytä tätä kevyttunnusta jatkossa kirjautuessasi Helsingin yliopiston "
"palveluihin. \n"
"\n"
"Saat lisätietoja käyttäjätunnuksen käytöstä IT-Helpdeskin ohjeesta "
"%(help_link)s"

#: kamu/templates/email/account_created_subject.txt:1
msgid "Your limited user account is ready"
msgstr "Kevyttunnuksesi on valmis"

#: kamu/templates/email/account_password_reset_message.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hi,\n"
"\n"
"You have successfully changed your limited user account password at the "
"University of Helsinki.\n"
"\n"
"From now on, please use your new password when logging in to the University "
"of Helsinki services.\n"
"\n"
"If you did not make this change, reset your password immediately and contact "
"the IT Helpdesk: %(help_link)s"
msgstr ""
"Hei, Olet vaihtanut onnistuneesti kevyttunnuksesi salasanan Helsingin "
"yliopiston Kamu-rekisterissä. Käytä uutta salasanaasi jatkossa "
"kirjautuessasi Helsingin yliopiston palveluihin. Mikäli et ole vaihtanut "
"salasanaasi, ota pikaisesti yhteyttä Helsingin yliopiston Helpdeskiin: "
"%(help_link)s"

#: kamu/templates/email/account_password_reset_subject.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid "Password changed: %(uid)s"
msgstr "Salasana vaihdettu: %(uid)s"

#: kamu/templates/email/expire_notification_member_message.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hi\n"
"\n"
"Your membership in the role %(role)s at the University of Helsinki will end "
"on %(expire_date)s.\n"
"\n"
"If you need the membership to continue, please contact your university "
"contact person."
msgstr ""
"Hei\n"
"\n"
"Helsingin yliopiston roolijäsenyytesi päättyy pian.\n"
"\n"
"Rooli:\n"
"%(role)s\n"
"\n"
"Päättymispäivä:\n"
"%(expire_date)s\n"
"\n"
"Olethan yhteydessä yliopiston yhteyshenkilöösi, jos jäsenyytesi pitäisi\n"
"jatkua."

#: kamu/templates/email/expire_notification_member_message.txt:7
#, python-format
msgid "You were invited by %(inviter)s."
msgstr "Kutsun sinulle lähetti %(inviter)s."

#: kamu/templates/email/expire_notification_member_message.txt:8
#, python-format
msgid "Your membership was approved by %(approver)s."
msgstr "Roolijäsenyytesi hyväksyi %(approver)s."

#: kamu/templates/email/expire_notification_member_subject.txt:1
msgid "Your membership is ending soon"
msgstr "Jäsenyytesi päättyy pian"

#: kamu/templates/email/expire_notification_role_message.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hi\n"
"\n"
"Log in to Kamu %(service_link)s to check expiring memberships for the role "
"%(role)s and extend them if necessary. You can find it under Expiring "
"memberships. If there are no memberships on the list, someone else has "
"already processed them.\n"
"\n"
"Number of memberships expiring soon: %(number_of_memberships)s"
msgstr ""
"Hei\n"
"\n"
"Kirjaudu Kamuun %(service_link)s tarkistaaksesi roolin %(role)s päättyvät "
"jäsenyydet ja jatka niitä tarvittaessa. Löydät ne kohdasta Päättyvät "
"jäsenyydet. Jos listalla ei ole jäsenyyksiä, joku muu on jo ottanut ne "
"hoitaakseen.\n"
"\n"
"Päättyvien jäsenyyksien lukumäärä: %(number_of_memberships)s"

#: kamu/templates/email/expire_notification_role_subject.txt:1
msgid "Expiring Kamu memberships"
msgstr "Päättyvät jäsenyydet"

#: kamu/templates/email/invite_email_message.txt:2
msgid "Hello,"
msgstr "Hei,"

#: kamu/templates/email/invite_email_message.txt:4
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(inviter)s has invited you to join the University of Helsinki in the role "
"of "
msgstr "%(inviter)s on kutsunut sinut Helsingin yliopistoon jäseneksi rooliin "

#: kamu/templates/email/invite_email_message.txt:4
msgid ""
"You have been invited to join the University of Helsinki in the role of "
msgstr "Olet saanut kutsun rooliin Helsingin yliopistolla. "

#: kamu/templates/email/invite_email_message.txt:6
msgid ""
"Register as a member using the personal link below. After registration, you "
"will receive the services related to your membership, such as your username."
msgstr ""
"Rekisteröidy jäseneksi alla olevan henkilökohtaisen linkin avulla. "
"Rekisteröitymisen jälkeen saat jäsenyyteesi liittyvät palvelut, kuten "
"esimerkiksi käyttäjätunnuksen."

#: kamu/templates/email/invite_email_message.txt:10
msgid "Your personal invitation code is:"
msgstr "Henkilökohtainen kutsukoodisi on:"

#: kamu/templates/email/invite_email_subject.txt:1
msgid "The University of Helsinki welcomes you"
msgstr "Tervetuloa Helsingin yliopistoon"

#: kamu/templates/email/login_verification_email_message.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hi\n"
"\n"
"Your personal verification code is:\n"
"%(token)s\n"
"\n"
"If you have not tried to log in to the University of Helsinki’s Kamu "
"register, you can safely ignore this email."
msgstr ""
"Hei\n"
"\n"
"Henkilökohtainen vahvistuskoodisi on:\n"
"%(token)s\n"
"\n"
"Jos et ole yrittänyt kirjautua Kamuun, voit jättää tämä viestin\n"
"huomiotta."

#: kamu/templates/email/login_verification_email_subject.txt:1
msgid "Kamu login verification"
msgstr "Kamu-kirjautumisen vahvistus"

#: kamu/templates/email/membership_add_message.txt:1
#: kamu/templates/email/membership_require_approval_role_message.txt:1
msgid "Hi"
msgstr "Hei"

#: kamu/templates/email/membership_add_message.txt:3
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(inviter)s has invited you to join the University of Helsinki in the role "
"of %(role)s."
msgstr "%(inviter)s on kutsunut sinut liittymään rooliin: %(role)s."

#: kamu/templates/email/membership_add_message.txt:3
msgid ""
"You have been added to the role of {{ role }} at the University of Helsinki."
msgstr "Sinut on lisätty Helsingin yliopiston roolliin {{ role }}"

#: kamu/templates/email/membership_add_message.txt:5
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You can view your information and the services granted to you in the "
"University of Helsinki’s Kamu register %(service_link)s.\""
msgstr ""
"Voit tarkastella tietojasi ja sinulle myönnettyjä palveluita Helsingin "
"yliopiston Kamu-rekisterissä %(service_link)s."

#: kamu/templates/email/membership_add_subject.txt:1
msgid "You’ve been granted a new role"
msgstr "Sinulle on myönnetty uusi rooli"

#: kamu/templates/email/membership_approved_member_message.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hi\n"
"\n"
"Your membership in the role %(role)s at the University of Helsinki has been "
"approved.\n"
"\n"
"You can view your information and the services granted to you in the "
"University of Helsinki’s Kamu register %(service_link)s."
msgstr ""
"Hei\n"
"\n"
"Jäsenyytesi Helsingin yliopiston rooliin %(role)s on hyväksytty.\n"
"\n"
"Voit tarkastella tietojasi ja sinulle myönnettyjä palveluita Helsingin "
"yliopiston Kamu-rekisterissä %(service_link)s."

#: kamu/templates/email/membership_approved_member_subject.txt:1
