msgstr "Jäsenyytesi on hyväksytty"

#: kamu/templates/email/membership_cancelled_member_message.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hi\n"
"\n"
"Your membership in the role %(role)s at the University of Helsinki has been "
"cancelled.\n"
"\n"
"For more information, please contact %(contact_email)s."
msgstr ""
"Hei\n"
"\n"
"Jäsenyytesi rooliin %(role)s Helsingin yliopistossa on peruttu.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Lisätietoja saat %(contact_email)s."

#: kamu/templates/email/membership_cancelled_member_subject.txt:1
msgid "Your role membership has been cancelled"
msgstr "Jäsenyytesi rooliin on peruttu"

#: kamu/templates/email/membership_rejected_member_message.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hi\n"
"\n"
"Your membership in the role %(role)s at the University of Helsinki has been "
"rejected.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"For more information, please contact %(contact_email)s."
msgstr ""
"Hei\n"
"\n"
"Jäsenyytesi rooliin %(role)s Helsingin yliopistossa on hylätty.\n"
"\n"
"Lisätietoja saat osoitteesta: %(contact_email)s."

#: kamu/templates/email/membership_rejected_member_subject.txt:1
msgid "Your role membership has been rejected"
msgstr "Jäsenyytesi Helsingin yliopiston rooliin on hylätty"

#: kamu/templates/email/membership_require_approval_role_message.txt:3
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(inviter)s has sent an invitation from Kamu for the role of %(role)s. Log "
"in to Kamu %(service_link)s to approve or reject the new membership for the "
"role."
msgstr ""
"%(inviter)s on lähettänyt Kamu-kutsun rooliin %(role)s. Kirjaudu Kamuun "
"%(service_link)s hyväksyäksesi tai hylätäksesi uuden jäsenyyden rooliin."

#: kamu/templates/email/membership_require_approval_role_message.txt:5
msgid ""
"You can find the membership under Memberships pending approval. If there are "
"no memberships on the list, someone else has already processed it."
msgstr ""
"Voit tarkastella jäsenyyttä kohdasta Odottaa hyväksyntää. Jos listalla ei "
